00:44:32,380 --> 00:44:35,080
Or shop online at HistoryChannel.com.

520
00:44:36,140 --> 00:44:39,740
It used to be Roundup, Rope, and Brandon, then off in search of dinner.

521
00:44:40,320 --> 00:44:44,420
Today, cattle ranching is a far cry from the world of the 19th century cowboy.

522
00:44:45,040 --> 00:44:50,700
Its focus is on recreating cattle to meet consumer needs despite competition, disease, and controversy.

